  <Placemark>
   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued November 28 at 12:22PM CST until November 30 at 2:00AM CST by NWS Houston/Galveston TX</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...South winds 20-25 kt tonight with higher gusts, shifting
to the northwest 25-30 kt with higher gusts by mid-morning
Sunday. Seas 6 to 9 ft.

* WHERE...Waters from Freeport to Matagorda Ship Channel TX from
20 to 60 NM and Waters from High Island to Freeport TX from 20
to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Until 2 AM CST Monday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
