   <name>Gale Watch issued November 28 at 1:21PM EST until November 30 at 7:00AM EST by NWS Wilmington NC</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_moderate</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Southwest winds 25 to 30 kt with gusts up to 35 kt and
seas 5 to 8 ft possible.

* WHERE...Southeast North Carolina and Northeast South Carolina
coastal waters out 20 NM.

* WHEN...From late Sunday night through Monday morning.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds can cause hazardous seas which could
capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.</Snippet>
